SUMMARY:Holy Hangouts (Offsite)
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a weekly small group Bible study at the Black/Carter homes (switching monthly)! All are welcome! There will be some element of childcare/kids activities. The small group will be hosted by the Blacks\, Nortons\, and Carter families. Tuesdays\, 7:00-8:30PM starting back up on September 22nd.
