SUMMARY:Gentle Yoga (Zoom)
DESCRIPTION:Yogis\, Chair Yoga will be on ZOOM for the next few weeks while construction is finishing on the Interim Offices.  Please find the Link below to join the fun!! \nClick here to join the meeting.  The meeting will be open at 10:15 so you have time to get set up.  Use a sturdy chair without arms or wheels.  Have a candle and a water bottle nearby. \nHere is another way to join the ZOOM meeting: \nMeeting ID: 842 2532 3468\nPasscode: 859443 \nThere are videos of past classes on our private YouTube channel here.
